# Pricebook IMPEX (pricebook.xsd)

Before changing pricebook XML builders, **read** `.cursor/references/sfcc-xsd/pricebook.xsd`. Sequences are ordered. A valid element in the wrong place fails import (`cvc-complex-type.2.4.a`).

Namespace: `http://www.demandware.com/xml/impex/pricebook/2006-10-31`. Root is `<pricebooks>` containing `<pricebook>` children. Skip empty optional elements. Do not invent tags.

## Pricebook

`header` (required) → `price-tables`

## Header (`complexType.Header`)

`pricebook-id` is required. `currency` is required (`[A-Z]{3}`).

`currency` → `display-name` → `description` → `online-flag` → `online-from` → `online-to` → `parent` → `feed-based` → `custom-attributes`

`display-name` and `description` are localized (`xml:lang`). Custom attributes belong on the **header**, not on a price-table.

## Price table (`complexType.PriceTable`)

`product-id` is required (max 100).

`online-from` → `online-to` → (`amount` | `percentage`)* → `price-info`

`<amount>` / `<percentage>` use attribute **`quantity`** (not `order-value` — that is shipping.xsd). No `custom-attributes` on price-table.

Builders: `pricebookMigration/pricebookXmlBuilder.js`, `productMigration/priceBookXmlBuilder.js`.
